  "about": "The tractus of the formulary “First Passion Sunday” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Often have they fought against me from my youth. Let Israel now say: often have they fought against me from my youth. Yet they could not prevail against me; the sinners wrought upon my back. They prolonged their iniquities; the just Lord hath cut the necks of sinners." }
